Package: distroclone-usb
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Franco Conidi <fconidi@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, librsvg2-common, xorriso, fdisk, e2fsprogs, dosfstools, grub-common, grub2-common, grub-pc-bin, grub-efi-amd64-bin, udev, pkexec, polkitd, udisks2, cryptsetup-bin, initramfs-tools-core
Recommends: policykit-1-gnome | polkit-kde-agent-1 | mate-polkit, adwaita-icon-theme
Homepage: https://www.syslinuxos.com
Description: Create persistent live USB drives from Debian and Ubuntu desktop ISOs
 Graphical companion to distroClone and distroclone-backup.
 Creates GPT USB media with BIOS and unsigned x86-64 UEFI boot,
 an intact live ISO and a separate ext4 persistence partition.
 Supports recognized Debian live-boot and Ubuntu casper profiles.
 Requires Secure Boot to be disabled. MX/antiX is not yet supported.
